					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "WITHIN\nThe Within node checks if the incoming value falls within its range. \nThe node outputs a boolean(true\/false).\nYou can choose to included the upper and lower values as you see fit.\n\nThis node can be used to check wheter a certain value is within bounds.\nBecause color is also a value, you can check if a certain color range is present in the texture."
					}
